The '''2022 Wokingham Borough Council election''' took place as of Thursday 5 May 2022. That was the same day as other [[2022 United Kingdom local elections|United Kingdom local elections]] in order to elect members of [[Wokingham (borough)|Wokingham]] [[Unitary authority|Unitary]] Council in [[Berkshire]], England. One third of the council, 18 seats, was up for election and the [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative Party]] lost control of the council, but was the largest group.<ref name="Wokingham Borough Council">{{cite news|url=https://www.wokingham.gov.uk/council-and-meetings/elections-and-voting/borough-council-election-results-2022/|title=Borough Council Election Results 2022|date=6 May 2022|work=Wokingham Borough Council|access-date=6 May 2022}}</ref>

